+		 * code. w->grabbed () is only true here if this click just
+		 * started a move/resize of the window; skip focusing it if it
+		 * matches the winrules no_focus_on_drag_match option (it is
+		 * still raised above). */
 	        if (w->id () != privateScreen.orphanData.activeWindow)
